  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3k0vHcn.png\" alt=\"鄉村農場 | 簡單起點 | 一座逼真的生存屋舍/穀倉。完美搭配《混亂山脈》！ | Minecraft 地圖\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IqBPn4v.png\" alt=\"簡單起點：節慶巷 || 雙版本支援 || PaleoTech || Minecraft 地圖\"><br><br><br></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">準備好在猩紅海域生存了嗎？<br>探索這座科幻恐怖風格的生存基地，在詭譎的海洋中努力存活。<br><br>特色包含：<br>高度精細的鑽油平台與《鐵肺》啟發的潛水艇。<br>在廣闊海洋種子中具挑戰性的出生點<br>有限的物資<br>以及更多內容。盡情探索吧！<br><br>強烈建議搭配使用我們的專屬材質包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">「鐵血海洋」</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1455150/description_05c0628a-3320-49f7-b0f5-b5555e5695f1.png\"></a><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DMW8yTV.png\" alt=\"鐵肺基地 | 簡單起點 | 受《鐵肺》啟發的生存基地 | PaleoTech Minecraft 地圖\"><br><br></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>喜歡我們的內容嗎？<br>別忘了追蹤我們並加入 Discord 社群！<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/maE2pZ3.png\" alt=\"簡單起點：遺忘莊園 || PaleoTech || Minecraft 地圖\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3thMh9qhGG\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/3thMh9qhGG</a><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fpaleotech%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1yhBqxN.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/paleotech/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PY2lVwI.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpPsHX1.png\" alt=\"\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oL8Cpz7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
